# Imunify360

> Imunify360 is a comprehensive Linux web server security platform for hosting providers, agencies, developers, and server administrators who need malware detection, automated cleanup, firewall protection, WAF, proactive defense, anti-bot protection, and server-level security automation.

Imunify360 protects Linux-based web hosting servers using a multi-layer security approach that includes malware scanning, real-time threat detection, Proactive Defense, Web Application Firewall, intrusion detection/prevention, reputation management, and automated cleanup. It is designed for shared hosting, VPS, dedicated servers, hosting control panels, and standalone Linux server environments.

